{"id":"n60442-1-8","stage":5,"title":"빙수 · 刨冰","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60442-1-8-1","ko":"우리 더운데 빙수나 먹으러 갈까?","zh":"今天这么热，我们一起去吃冰沙吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"더운데","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운데","audio":"/audio/6a4a31748d07da622588.mp3"}},{"text":"빙수나","meaning":"刨冰，沙冰","explanation":"빙수：刨冰，沙冰；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"빙수","audio":"/audio/c7a667db34e1c0ac7e05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60442","senseId":"1","lemma":"빙수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빙수나","audio":"/audio/f56e3902e0ab02edaad6.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으러","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으러","audio":"/audio/3bc7725f95e57fc73de6.mp3"}},{"text":"갈까?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈까","audio":"/audio/0e3718549837ff797d8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"c7a667db34e1c0ac","term":"빙수","zh":"刨冰，沙冰","audio":"/audio/c7a667db34e1c0ac7e05.mp3","entryId":"60442","definition":"将冰块刨成雪花，并在上面配上煮熟的红豆、水果等配料而制成的食物。","pronunciation":["빙수"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d5dff133e0850291b04.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60442-1-8-2","ko":"나는 찬 걸 먹으면 배가 아파서 못 먹어.","zh":"我吃凉的东西会肚子疼，所以不能吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"찬","meaning":"冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉","explanation":"차다：冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37235","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬","audio":"/audio/e3d8eeabff7c4506e9b3.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseI